#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaf405-mini.rst:61
#: 6f19d9b2599e4bdfa163ea2889440e8a
msgid ""
"The UARTs are marked RXn and TXn in the above pinouts. The RXn pin is the "
"receive pin for UARTn. The TXn pin is the transmit pin for UARTn. Default "
"protocols for each port are shown and may be changed by the user."
msgstr ""
"上方引脚图中，UART 标注为 RXn 和 TXn。RXn 引脚为 UARTn 的接收引脚，TXn 引脚为 UARTn "
"的发送引脚。每个接口的默认协议如图所示，用户可自行更改。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaf405-mini.rst:63
#: c20f207502654cf5b16083ac0bad7aac
msgid "SERIAL0 -> USB"
msgstr "SERIAL0 -> USB"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaf405-mini.rst:64
#: b72931348feb4bc6ab0be63064142bfd
msgid "SERIAL1 -> USART1 (RX/SBUS)"
msgstr "SERIAL1 -> USART1（RX/SBUS）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaf405-mini.rst:65
#: 93007ca43aca4a01a630a5c7983e8cd8
msgid "SERIAL2 -> USART2 (GPS, DMA-enabled)"
