#: 33d4cf013d344c9587e67e3610c3a0dc
msgid "SERIAL5 -> UART5  (Unavailable, not pinned out)"
msgstr "SERIAL5 -> UART5（不可用，未引出引脚）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaf405-mini.rst:69
#: 397ef4ea0eae4b40929eb02a59a5f7c3
msgid "SERIAL6 -> USART6 (RX only, ESC Telem, DMA capable)"
msgstr "SERIAL6 -> USART6（仅 RX，ESC 数传，支持 DMA）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaf405-mini.rst:72
#: 5fa9dc81c98b43d9be9919c08bfd5a90
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaf405-mini.rst:74
#: 7c384beadc67414494481ac5b1722459
msgid ""
"RC input is configured on the RX1 (UART1_RX) pin. It supports all serial RC "
"protocols."
msgstr "RC 输入配置在 RX1（UART1_RX）引脚上，支持所有串行 RC 协议。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaf405-mini.rst:76
#: 609e107b536c43ffb080a38a55c8dec1
msgid ""
":ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL<SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` is set to \"23\" by default, and:"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL<SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` 默认设置为「23」，并且："

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaf405-mini.rst:78
#: 7fa71ecff70645df8f4bc75c1eb4e7a1
msgid "PPM is not supported."
msgstr "不支持 PPM。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaf405-mini.rst:80
#: c01e645cd6384a988606524f20dad398
msgid ""
"SBUS/DSM/SRXL connects to the RX1 pin, but SBUS requires that the "
":ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` be set to \"3\"."
msgstr ""
"SBUS/DSM/SRXL 连接到 RX1 引脚，但 SBUS 需要将 :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` "
"设置为「3」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaf405-mini.rst:82
#: 1a928142355b4825b55db280d29a3e1a
msgid ""
"FPort requires connection to TX1 and :ref:`SERIAL7_OPTIONS<SERIAL7_OPTIONS>`"
" be set to \"7\"."
msgstr "FPort 需连接到 TX1，并将 :ref:`SERIAL7_OPTIONS<SERIAL7_OPTIONS>` 设置为「7」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaf405-mini.rst:84
#: f004d37754e646a2a99f1c127cc93b09
msgid ""
"CRSF also requires a TX1 connection, in addition to RX1, and automatically "
"provides telemetry. Set :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL7_OPTIONS>` to \"0\"."
msgstr ""
"CRSF 除 RX1 外还需要 TX1 连接，并自动提供数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL7_OPTIONS>` "
"设置为「0」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaf405-mini.rst:86
#: 7cbb1dc6bad941f990ff81a555b3a6e6
msgid ""
"SRXL2 requires a connection to TX1 and automatically provides telemetry.  "
"Set :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` to \"4\"."
msgstr ""
"SRXL2 需连接 TX1 并自动提供数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL1_OPTIONS<SERIAL1_OPTIONS>` 设置为「4」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaf405-mini.rst:88
#: f4a46e437e264d509e3e7a2fd8dcb96d
msgid ""
"Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"在 ArduPilot 中，任何 UART 都可用于 RC 系统连接，并兼容除 PPM 外的所有协议。详情请参阅 :ref:`common-rc-"
"systems`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaf405-mini.rst:91
#: 777f33d2e375446b9bdb1856f91fc1c7
msgid "FrSky Telemetry"
msgstr "FrSky 数传"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaf405-mini.rst:93
#: 266baacc121546129ed5f095255a4684
msgid ""
"FrSky Telemetry is supported using any UART TX pin. You need to set the "
"following parameters to enable support for FrSky S.PORT (example given for "
"UART4)"
msgstr "任意 UART TX 引脚均支持 FrSky 数传。需设置以下参数以启用 FrSky S.PORT 支持（以 UART4 为例）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaf405-mini.rst:95
#: c685cfbfc0154c4ea2a4d7dfbfb90e51
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL<SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` = 10"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL<SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` = 10"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaf405-mini.rst:96
#: a7abb7128d9643f49d3dace44d54a8c4
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` = 7"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` = 7"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaf405-mini.rst:99
#: 4bc1e975194d4091a2e3c7f607418348
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaf405-mini.rst:101
#: e9d4bb670c944f6885b7e85ff7e0cc13
msgid ""
"The Mamba MK4 F405Mini supports internal OSD using :ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>`"
" = 1 (MAX7456 driver)."
msgstr ""
"Mamba MK4 F405Mini 支持使用 :ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` = 1（MAX7456 驱动）的内置 OSD。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaf405-mini.rst:104
#: c0413609840e4007919b62a0a28a756d
msgid "DJI Video"
msgstr "DJI 视频"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaf405-mini.rst:106
#: 27bfc3ec22b14a6ab9051d324bb6a755
msgid ""
"A standard DJI video connector is provided. Set :ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` to"
" \"3\" (MSP) or \"5\" (DisplayPort) depending on use, and set "
":ref:`SERIAL3_PROTOCOL<SERIAL3_PROTOCOL>` to \"32\" (MSP) or \"42\" "
"(DisplayPort) also."
msgstr ""
"提供标准 DJI 视频接口。根据用途将 :ref:`OSD_TYPE<OSD_TYPE>` "
"设置为「3」（MSP）或「5」（DisplayPort），同时将 :ref:`SERIAL3_PROTOCOL<SERIAL3_PROTOCOL>` "
"设置为「32」（MSP）或「42」（DisplayPort）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaf405-mini.rst:109
#: 3c5a490eab7a4be689312b6a29d24228
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaf405-mini.rst:111
#: 0b42b905b51f416988aa2c215b5e5153
msgid ""
"The Mamba MK4 F405Mini supports up to 7 PWM outputs, all are DShot capable. "
"The pads for motor output M1 to M4 are provided on  the motor connector and "
"are BDShot capable, plus there is M7 on a separate pad for LED strip or "
"another PWM output."
msgstr ""
"Mamba MK4 F405Mini 最多支持 7 路 PWM 输出，全部支持 DShot。电机接口上的 M1~M4 焊盘支持 BDShot，另有 M7"
" 独立焊盘用于 LED 灯带或其他 PWM 输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaf405-mini.rst:113
#: 0680c14f16d1404bbc78de5f4b80f53b
msgid "The PWM is in 4 groups:"
msgstr "PWM 分为 4 组："

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaf405-mini.rst:115
#: e1c39a4d4d7c40f9a4df9449b1d62e6d
msgid ""
"PWM 1,2 in group1  (if used for :ref:`GPIOs <common-gpios>` their reference "
"pin numbers are 50 and 51, respectively)"
msgstr "PWM 1、2 在组1（若用作 :ref:`GPIO <common-gpios>`，参考引脚编号分别为 50 和 51）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaf405-mini.rst:116
#: 7c5360ac058c41e18a6635f6144fe73a
msgid ""
"PWM 3,4 in group2 (if used for :ref:`GPIOs <common-gpios>` their reference "
"pin numbers are 52 and 53, respectively)"
msgstr "PWM 3、4 在组2（若用作 :ref:`GPIO <common-gpios>`，参考引脚编号分别为 52 和 53）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaf405-mini.rst:117
#: 373f2534186143ee8162c8ecee8d45f5
msgid ""
"PWM 5,6 in group3 (if used for :ref:`GPIOs <common-gpios>` their reference "
"pin numbers are 54 and 55, respectively)"
msgstr "PWM 5、6 在组3（若用作 :ref:`GPIO <common-gpios>`，参考引脚编号分别为 54 和 55）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaf405-mini.rst:118
#: 2f3763e75e4d442db367e687caa6f213
msgid ""
"PWM 7 (LED) in group4 (if used for :ref:`GPIOs <common-gpios>` its reference"
" pin number is 56)"
msgstr "PWM 7（LED）在组4（若用作 :ref:`GPIO <common-gpios>`，参考引脚编号为 56）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaf405-mini.rst:120
#: c305f2f9e01140e9b109af69a8dced6d
msgid ""
"Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate. If any "
"channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the group need to use "
"DShot. Channels 1-4 support bi-directional DShot."
msgstr ""
"同组内的通道需要使用相同的输出速率。如果组内任何通道使用 DShot，则该组所有通道均需使用 DShot。通道 1-4 支持双向 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaf405-mini.rst:123
#: bbc5f82f381041bdb2412809ac65287c
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr "电池监测"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaf405-mini.rst:125
#: 0f964120deb5490390c9f378315dc7b2
msgid ""
"The board does not have a built-in current sensor. The voltage sensor can "
"handle up to 6S LiPo batteries."
msgstr "该板没有内置电流传感器。电压传感器最高支持 6S 锂电池。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaf405-mini.rst:127
#: 144a15ff12704c69a9bd1bcd65045934
msgid "Typical battery setting parameters are:"
msgstr "典型电池设置参数为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaf405-mini.rst:129
#: 4dc1145a8d0a435281e2ef5bdf1e673b
msgid ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` = 4"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` = 4"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaf405-mini.rst:130
#: 47dd844c84144c0d846b81f7e618722e
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaf405-mini.rst:131
#: 5c9ef0a384e348fb81f16480b34746a6
msgid ":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 13"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 13"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaf405-mini.rst:132
#: e436c66919c849b28101661bbdf6c094
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11.1"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11.1"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaf405-mini.rst:133
#: 91c818c8b486434d9daae5ce313d202c
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 64 (will "
"depend on external current sensor)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = "
"64（取决于外部电流传感器）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaf405-mini.rst:136
#: e4c9b33695264332a7ddaf23409047ad
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaf405-mini.rst:138
#: ecfee5c9740445858e18de14bde94d8a
msgid ""
"The Mamba MK4 F405Mini does not have a built-in compass, but you can attach "
"an external compass using I2C on the SDA and SCL pads."
msgstr "Mamba MK4 F405Mini 没有内置罗盘，但可通过 SDA 和 SCL 焊盘使用 I2C 连接外部罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaf405-mini.rst:141
#: 675297b5ae814b0e9e8f54497193ab4b
msgid "RSSI"
msgstr "RSSI"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaf405-mini.rst:143
#: fa816a899fde439da415283a4ab47632
msgid ""
"Analog RSSI input, if used, :ref:`RSSI_ANA_PIN<RSSI_ANA_PIN>` should be set "
"to \"12\"."
msgstr "如使用模拟 RSSI 输入，:ref:`RSSI_ANA_PIN<RSSI_ANA_PIN>` 应设置为「12」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaf405-mini.rst:146
#: c53dad4162a546e788d19514a4ee2db0
msgid "Loading Firmware"
msgstr "加载固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaf405-mini.rst:148
#: 31549a68ffc64246906b316469af4541
msgid ""
"Firmware for this board can be found `here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ in  sub-folders labeled "
"\"MambaF405-2022\"."
msgstr ""
"此板的固件可在 `这里 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ "
"找到，位于标有「MambaF405-2022」的子文件夹中。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaf405-mini.rst:150
#: c1537e8076b14d1abe1651e6bdcbcf9e
msgid ""
"Initial firmware load can be done with DFU by plugging in USB with the "
"bootloader button pressed. Then you should load the \"with_bl.hex\" "
"firmware, using your favourite DFU loading tool. See :ref:`common-loading-"
"firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards`."
msgstr ""
"初始固件可通过 DFU 方式加载：在按住引导程序按钮的同时插入 USB，然后使用您喜爱的 DFU 烧录工具加载「with_bl.hex」固件。参见 "
":ref:`common-loading-firmware-onto-chibios-only-boards`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mambaf405-mini.rst:154
#: 8998abbee9a94a1c91dcac427988067a
msgid ""
"Once the initial firmware is loaded you can update the firmware using any "
"ArduPilot ground station software. Later updates should be done with the "
"\\*.apj firmware files."
msgstr "初始固件加载完成后，可使用任意ArduPilot地面站软件更新固件。后续更新请使用 \\*.apj 固件文件。"
